// The 4 carve directions as (dx,dz) *2 grid steps -- since room cells sit at
// odd (x,z) and the wall between two adjacent rooms is the even coordinate
// between them, moving from one room to its neighbor is always +/-2 in
// exactly one axis. Table-indexed (like trig/table.id's sine table) instead
// of an if-chain, to keep dir_dx/dir_dz (../dirs.id) at 0 actions.

dx_table() {
  int[] tbl = [0, 0, 0 - 2, 2];
} return int[] tbl;

dz_table() {
  int[] tbl = [0 - 2, 2, 0, 0];
} return int[] tbl;
